],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 that middle ran 234% of normal in March to April and 44% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 26% of normal. Grid 18430 had its driest year in 1954 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
